= The Nominee

The incumbent Republican administration is deeply unpopular in some quarters and beloved in others. The party must choose a standard-bearer for 2024.

- @gov: A governor.
- @vp: The Vice President.

@gov
subtitle: Fresh face.
on-arrival: nominee = "Newsom"; pop_mod += 0.2

A governor takes the nomination.

@vp
subtitle: Continuity.
on-arrival: nominee = "Harris"; pop_mod += 0.0

The Vice President takes the nomination.
